<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Computer Hub</title>

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#f5f5f5;
    color:#222;
}

header{
    background:white;
    padding:20px 10%;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;
}

header h1{
    font-size:28px;
}

nav a{
    text-decoration:none;
    color:#333;
    margin-left:20px;
}

.hero{
    text-align:center;
    padding:80px 10%;
}

.hero h2{
    font-size:45px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.hero p{
    color:#666;
    font-size:18px;
}

.button{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:25px;
    padding:12px 25px;
    background:#111;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:5px;
}

section{
    background:white;
    margin:20px 10%;
    padding:40px;
    border-radius:10px;
}

section h2{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.cards{
    display:flex;
    gap:20px;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.card{
    width:250px;
    padding:25px;
    border:1px solid #ddd;
    border-radius:10px;
    text-align:center;
}

.card h3{
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

footer{
    background:#111;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
    margin-top:40px;
}


@media(max-width:700px){

header{
    flex-direction:column;
}

nav{
    margin-top:15px;
}

.hero h2{
    font-size:32px;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>


<header>

<h1>Computer Hub</h1>

<nav>
<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#parts">Components</a>
</nav>

</header>



<div class="hero">

<h2>Explore the World of Computers</h2>

<p>
Learn the basics of computer technology, hardware,
and how computers help people every day.
</p>

<a class="button" href="#parts">
Learn More
</a>

</div>



<section id="about">

<h2>About Computers</h2>

<p>
Computers are electronic devices that process information,
store data, and help people complete different tasks faster
and easier. They are used in education, business, communication,
and entertainment.
</p>

</section>



<section id="parts">

<h2>Computer Components</h2>

<div class="cards">


<div class="card">
<h3>CPU</h3>
<p>
The brain of the computer that processes instructions
and controls operations.
</p>
</div>


<div class="card">
<h3>RAM</h3>
<p>
Temporary memory that helps programs run smoothly
and quickly.
</p>
</div>


<div class="card">
<h3>Storage</h3>
<p>
Stores files, applications, photos, and important data.
</p>
</div>


<div class="card">
<h3>GPU</h3>
<p>
Handles graphics, videos, and gaming performance.
</p>
</div>


</div>

</section>



<section>

<h2>Project Creator</h2>

<p style="text-align:center;">
